# Copy to `leakgate.local.txt` (gitignored) and list the strings that must
# never appear in this repository: your company name, internal domains,
# product codenames, ticket-key prefixes.
#
# One pattern per line. `#` starts a comment. Matching is case-insensitive.
# A line starting with `re:` is treated as a JavaScript regular expression.
#
# The point of keeping this file out of git: a public repo that ships a list
# of your internal names has leaked the list.

# examples — replace with your own
# acme-corp
# internal.acme.example
# re:ACME-\d+
